WEBVTT

00:08:57.283 --> 00:09:00.035
to volunteer, to contribute, to lobby,

00:09:00.035 --> 00:09:04.123
or even to simply welcome a refugee
to advocate for them.

00:09:04.873 --> 00:09:06.959
As Margaret Mead once said,

00:09:06.959 --> 00:09:10.671
"Never doubt that a small group
of thoughtful, committed citizens

00:09:10.713 --> 00:09:12.047
can change the world.

00:09:12.089 --> 00:09:14.883
Indeed, it's the only thing
that ever has."

00:09:17.011 --> 00:09:19.513
On the afternoon
of my release 10 days ago,

00:09:19.555 --> 00:09:22.933
I, at long last, climbed out
of my basement cell

00:09:22.975 --> 00:09:24.184
and into the sunlight,

00:09:24.226 --> 00:09:27.229
without anything binding my hands
or covering my eyes.

00:09:28.314 --> 00:09:29.940
I could see the sky.